# EVA-NET 2.0 Environment Configuration
# Optional: Google Maps Platform JavaScript API Key
# If omitted or left empty, EVA-NET automatically runs in Autonomous Local Mode using Leaflet.
# Obtain a key from https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials
# Note: Restrict your production keys to specific HTTP referrers and authorized Maps APIs.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
